# API & console validation

## api-worker (`apps/api-worker/src/index.ts`, `auth-routes.ts`)

- Prefer existing helpers: `stringField`, `numberField`, `documentField`, `stringArray`, `invalid()`.
- Optional numbers: reject `NaN` and out-of-range (do not use bare `Number(searchParams.get(...))` without bounds).
- Path IDs: `asSiteId` / `asContentItemId` etc. after match; slug fields must reach `normalizeSlug` via kernel.
- Mutations: `resolveActorContext` + CSRF for cookie sessions.

## admin-web

- Validate on submit; map common `error.code` to Japanese where user-facing.
- Slug: `apps/admin-web/src/lib/slug.ts` must stay aligned with `packages/baser-domain` `normalizeSlug`.

## After changing a route

Update `docs/engineering/api-validation-audit.md` (status + tests column) in the same PR.
